Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,吾乃貓是也
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,雖這麼說有點自傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但吾確實以身為能幹貓而自傲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此 吾仍然有個煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,吾的飼主是個…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:43.90,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,700)\frz270\fn@方正兰亭细黑_GBK\b1\an5\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1624,756)}飼主 27歲 女性 上班族
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,連垃圾分類都學不會的人類是也
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.07,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8}笨蛋 金鱼脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可燃垃圾裡塞了塑膠垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,專門放塑膠垃圾的垃圾桶裡放的是寶特瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:01:02.33,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\frz270\fn@方正兰亭细黑_GBK\b1\an5\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1550.86,406.29)}丟垃圾前幫忙重新分類的貓
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.33,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an3}智人?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就連附近的烏鴉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,都能正確掌握收垃圾的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎麼一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:15.76,Default,,50,0,185,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs55\bord0\1c&0000FF&}可燃垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:15.76,Default,,1350,0,190,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs55\bord0\1c&000000&}塑膠類垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:15.75,Default,,0,1250,185,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs55\bord0\1c&FF0000&}寶特瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,居然有公司敢雇用如此廢的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,若她被解雇…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,吾只能立刻拋棄她另尋他處
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你改變了漢堡排醬汁的作法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.44,0:01:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是天才 超好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這到底怎麼做的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要再做給我吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好幸福喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:37.99,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,422.29)}能幹貓很能照顧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,電車即將進入第二月台…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:03:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:03:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託諭吉這件事 可能有點奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 還是拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,請你教我做料理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經穿好圍裙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,也做好各項準備了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,老師拜託你拜託你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:05:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的拿手料理只有泡麵的話人生就完蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.38,0:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,上週我才發現
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果沒有諭吉在身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是個無法好好照顧自己的廢柴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:13.29,注释,,850,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\blur1\3c&FFFFFFFF&\1c&000000&}上週的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\frz270\fn@方正兰亭细黑_GBK\b1\an5\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(320,430.67)}想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在公司裡卻漸漸被認為\N是個很會做料理的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,福澤小姐會做點心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真有女性魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我記得福澤每天都帶便當
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,妳會成為賢慧的妻子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我…完全不會做菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,福澤小姐這樣都不會做了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,前輩 請務必嫁給我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在被發現我的真面目之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望能慢慢減少跟虛幻人設的差距…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,事情就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,目標是 自己的便當自己做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}連猴子都會做的家庭料理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不過不過
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望從超簡單的料理開始學起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}飯糰 簡單的TKG
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:14.06,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\pos(490.67,519.33)\bord0\1c&000000&}簡單的生雞蛋拌飯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有點難耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這要打蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 我開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不過就是打蛋嘛 我會啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.17,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8}放馬過來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,放馬過來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我拿好蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,然後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,230)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1592,340.66)}打蛋 把蛋倒在飯上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,230)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1592,340.66)}再淋一圈醬油
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,230)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1609.33,340.66)}撒些佐料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,第一步的說明只有這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,打蛋的方法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs60\frz270\bord0\1c&000000&\pos(1583.81,400.85)}打蛋 把蛋倒在飯上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這哪算猴子也會做的生雞蛋拌飯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋殼就像佐料一樣撒在飯上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣可以補充鈣質…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 蛋殼好像有沙門什麼的危險細菌啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手好會拿筷子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼做到的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fn方正稚艺_GBK\blur2\3c&FFFFFF&\1c&000000&\pos(961.33,820.67)}就只是生雞蛋拌飯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:30.86,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs70}拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:30.88,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs55\bord0\1c&000000&\move(457.34,650,457.34,890,0,1000)}看著可悲生物的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:44.00,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}倒光…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,簡單的TKG
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒 是真正的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是除了泡麵以外的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有沒有…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有沒有更簡單的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不用打蛋 也不用倒醬油的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來 我們家有這本食譜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.43,0:09:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不記得我有這本書
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:21.04,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}漢堡排
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉不用看食譜就會做料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 這本食譜上的料理…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像…曾經看過…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這些全都是諭吉還是幼貓時做給我吃的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 這有什麼好害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好懷念喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因為你的手藝進步神速
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我都忘了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你邊看食譜 邊做給我吃的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,久違地我想吃這道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉剛開始做給我吃的飯糰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手手能捏出三角形飯糰耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼捏的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.81,0:10:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,做失敗了的生雞蛋拌飯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,之後 被諭吉做成了雞蛋粥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,手機裡的貪睡功能 要怎麼關掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:37.78,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(156,436.66)}衛生紙混入
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:47.66,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(616,589.99)}毛巾要用力甩夠後再晾\N然後絨毛才會蓬鬆和根根分明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.42,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs100\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(164,540.66)}清爽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:18.57,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs100\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(1493.33,565.99)}重洗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.96,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(253.33,677.99)}肉泥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:36.96,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(1682.67,276.66)}帳本
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:47.97,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(577.33,452.66)}看著餘額來安定身寧的貓
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,此時此刻 外面正下著一場與氣象預報大相逕庭的豪雨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,這場豪雨 預計會持續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,夜半時分 雨會越下越大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,需預防土石流來襲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思百忙之中打擾您
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,您現在撐的折疊傘 經常帶在身邊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 因為太常去便利商店買傘 回家會被罵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所以有人要我隨身帶著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,家裡便利商店的傘真的會越來越多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,還好有人提醒您隨身攜帶折疊傘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說啊 我很感謝牠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,雨越來越大了 回去時請小心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,百忙之中謝謝您願意受訪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來 是深受大家喜愛的單元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 今天的菜色太豪華了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來超好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,發生什麼好事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可以喝高級啤酒大人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,明天還會下雨嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,乾杯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,早上的雨好大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,還好有帶折疊傘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我買了個好東西喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:08.33,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}木天蓼 木枝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:11.42,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\an8}嗨翻天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\fs70\frz270\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(392,380.66)}這是木天蓼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你的拿法 拿法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-早安 -早
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,現在時間快早上六點五十分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的天氣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,全國都是好天氣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.09,0:16:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是個適合晾衣服的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,請多加利用今天的陽光
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:52.66,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}七點前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs70\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(788,880.66)}萬年睡過頭\N＆賴床慣犯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,早安…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭 我沒有發燒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是很少這麼早起 你很沒禮貌耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,體溫計是不是壞掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪有這麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:33.66,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}"快去請假"的氣場
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 今天…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.69,0:17:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,今天…不能請假啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,從早上開始就要開三場會議
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有時候就是不能因為一點小病而請假休息啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我平常嚷著要請假要休息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但我還是有身為社會人士的自覺
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.93,0:18:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷好冷…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,部長早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是福澤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是 是 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:41.22,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}感冒藥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,還請多包涵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我請了半天假
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我也沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你就別咂嘴了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,得在下午前退燒才行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:57.95,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}感冒藥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,流汗 讓自己流汗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,吃超辣料理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,然後泡熱呼呼的澡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉 不要阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\frz270\fs70\3c&FFFFFF&\blur1&\1c&000000&\pos(426.67,492.66)}單從消耗體力上來說\N就已經是反效果了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.39,0:19:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.77,0:19:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,諭吉你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我買貓罐罐回來囉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,之後 我會更努力工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:20:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,會買很多貓罐罐喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,請退到黃線後
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 現在幾點了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去公司
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好像…退燒了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺好像還是有點不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,最後還是請了一整天的假
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.43,0:23:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,吾乃能幹貓是也
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,能幹貓很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,海蛞蝓是軟體動物門腹足綱裸鰓目中無殼的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.81,0:23:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,簡而言之 是螺類的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一對觸覺器官像是角一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.98,0:23:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因此又被稱為海牛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.03,0:23:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,海蛞蝓 正是蛞蝓系偶像 UMYU-Sea 的原型
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,時間不夠了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.16,0:23:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,下一集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.58,0:23:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,能幹貓去水族館
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,吾很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:42.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(279,348.75)}インスタグラムにも載ってない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:45.12,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(274,342.5)}私の奥のこと見せたい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.41,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(229,286.25)}貴方だけの私に
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:50.33,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(295,368.75)}なってみたいなりたいなりたいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:53.29,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(292,365)}朝焼けの眼差しは冷たい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:55.92,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(265,331.25)}タバコが染みた服臭い
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:58.09,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(215,268.75)}夜が終わってもまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:22:00.80,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(269,336.25)}どこにも行けない帰さないで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:01.88,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(110,137.5)}Don't leave me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:03.55,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(140,175)}Do this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:05.97,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(244,305)}We can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:09.64,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(131,163.75)}We can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.64,0:22:11.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(138,172.5)}We can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:14.44,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(245,306.25)}これは　どうしようもなく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:17.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(236,295)}しょーもない恋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.06,0:22:20.57,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(349,436.25)}これもまた　好きになっちゃ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.57,0:22:23.32,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(278,347.5)}ダメとわかっていても…ってやつです
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:25.24,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(162,202.5)}I know　もうね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:28.58,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(290,362.5)}年頃ってやつが悪さをしていて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:31.50,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(275,343.75)}よくない男に惹かれちゃって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:34.16,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(265,331.25)}もっと　もっとで欲しくなって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:37.75,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(360,450)}摂氏0度で燃える青い東京
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.21,0:22:42.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(320,400)}夜の端くれだってそこそこに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:45.13,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(275,343.75)}私とあなたの真ん中で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.13,0:22:47.39,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(224,280)}要らないアイテム消して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:50.22,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(282,352.5)}冬の花と咲いてみたかったの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:53.23,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(303,378.75)}始発の電車は太陽より
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.23,0:22:56.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(279,348.75)}強く私はずかしめる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:58.77,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(273,341.25)}もうこれ以上朝にならないで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:02.61,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(100,403.75)}永遠に昨日で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:07.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(376,470)}たった一つだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:10.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(371,463.75)}君だけがいればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.69,0:02:18.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(705,881.25)}今日も明日も全てが　煌めいてゆく毎日が宝物です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:29.75,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(360,450)}ありきたりで単純に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:33.76,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(359,448.75)}人並みでいるはずだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:38.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(382,477.5)}当たり前を夢見ては
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.39,0:02:41.85,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(344,430)}器用に生きて損をする
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:45.23,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(340,425)}そんな時代です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:49.31,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(349,436.25)}こんな世の中です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:54.57,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(437,546.25)}空っぽな心を振り回しながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:59.28,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(473,591.25)}生きる意味はあるかい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:04.79,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(383,478.75)}何もいらない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:08.46,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(367,458.75)}君だけが愛おしい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:11.67,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(249,311.25)}気づけばそこにある拾い上げた
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.84,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(417,521.25)}ときめきがキラキラ羽ばたく
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:21.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(376,470)}こんな日常が
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:24.56,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(348,435)}続けばいいなんて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.19,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(161,201.25)}自分に素直なことが
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:32.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(528,660)}幸せへの近道にきっとなるから
